 - `Sequencer` now supports looping. Some fixes were also made.
 - New `AudioNode` tree introspection system in the module `graph`.
 - In order to take effect, `Sequencer` changes must now be committed to the backend.
+- Settings can be scheduled for `Sequencer` events with sample accuracy using `Sequencer::set_at`
+  and `Sequencer::set_at_relative`. Events are addressed with `Setting::event`.
+- New method `Sequencer::remove` for removing events.
+- Fixed `Sequencer` block processing of fades, inputs and loops.
 
 ### Version 0.23
 
