 ```
 
+Settings can be scheduled for events with sample accuracy.
+The event is picked with the `event` address of the setting.
+Scheduled settings are retained with the event and applied again when the event is replayed.
+
+```rust
+// Set the value of the constant 0.5 seconds from now.
+let id3 = sequencer.push_relative(0.0, 1.0, Fade::Smooth, 0.0, 0.0, Box::new(dc(0.5)));
+sequencer.set_at_relative(0.5, Setting::value(0.25).event(id3));
+// Remove the event with a fade-out time of 0.1 seconds. Removed events are not replayed.
+sequencer.remove(id1, 0.1);
+sequencer.commit();
+```
